    given-names: Indranil
    alias: Neel
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-09-02
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/indranilbanerjee/tagore-swaralipi"
url: "https://github.com/indranilbanerjee/tagore-swaralipi"
abstract: >
  An open dataset of thirty Rabindrasangeet across twenty taal families, digitized from akarmatrik swaralipi
  into a machine-readable symbolic JSON schema (swara, saptak, matra fractions,
  taal cycles, Bengali lyric alignment, provenance), with derived MIDI/MusicXML,
  notation-synthesized audio, and a blind AI-continuation experiment.
keywords: [Rabindrasangeet, Tagore, swaralipi, symbolic music, digital humanities, Bengali, music information retrieval]
